  "description": "Use this service request to report common nuisance animal offenses. Initial complaints will result in correspondence to the owner and the complainant (if they provide address) to educate them on the violation and the next steps. Owners are given up to 3 weeks to comply. If Dallas Animal Services receives additional complaints after the compliance date, there will be an investigation. Priority 8: Instances will be responded to within 15 Business Days.",
